Date: Fri, 4 Sep 2026 18:40:29 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 5/5] Nag unmanaged TUI builds from the grok-build OS repo, not
 stable.

needs_update() on the stable channel treats any pre-release suffix as
stale, so 1.0.16-omarchy.<sha> showed "v1.0.13 available" even though
the source tree was already ahead of the pointer. Skipping the check
dropped the nag entirely. Keep it: compare the running release
(stripping the -omarchy.<sha> pre-release) to the first CHANGELOG
version on xai-org/grok-build main. Do not download or run `grok
update`; Ctrl+U prints rebase instructions instead.
